- id: '2099362604166627389'
  text: '65 open-source tools and projects for seeing, building, automating, and checking
    what software does.


    This set runs from pull-request diagrams and bank access for AI assistants to
    formal fluid mathematics, browser spreadsheets, shader registries, and drone detection.
    It is for developers who want the actual project behind the demo, with the useful
    constraint or implementation detail left in.


    Full analysis in the first reply ↓'
