- id: '2099363281378873599'
  text: 'Open-Meteo is an open-source weather API returning forecast, current, and
    historical data as JSON over HTTP GET. It requires no authentication for non-commercial
    use and aggregates more than 30 national weather models.

    https://t.co/IOBnwmkkJT'
